# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root - every service that
# needs services/toolkit alongside it (a local `file:../toolkit` dependency,
# see services/toolkit/README.md): auth-service, create/update/delete-
# transaction-service, get-transactions-service, categories-service. The
# per-service .dockerignore files are ignored for these builds, so anything
# they exclude has to be excluded here too.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test
**/vitest.config.ts
.git
